# Product scope

- Product: adaptive SAFe DevOps maturity assessment across 16 practices
- Figma frontend in `src/` is the UX source of truth
- Pilot limits: one Jira Cloud env, one Azure DevOps Services env
- Per assessment: one representative Jira project + one ADO repository
- Core flows: evidence snapshot, voice workshop, remote typed contributors, adaptive next question, admin review, published radar/heatmap/report/plan
- Deploy: Railway for testing, OpenShift for final
- Storage: SQLite on persistent mount; exactly one app replica
- Do not expand into multi-environment or multi-replica designs without an ADR
